/-!
# Adjacency-profile obstruction to the first point leaving its max4 orbit

The fiber of the adjacency profile of 0 on the 28 marked points has at most
16 elements. Each point outside the first image set and the marked set has
at least 17 points in its profile fiber. Profile-fiber cardinality is invariant
under the full marked-set stabilizer, so that stabilizer sends 0 into the
first image set. This avoids any ambient or candidate order calculation.

The bit-vector profiles are checked against the certified orbital rows, and
all upper-bound and injection witnesses are checked by the kernel. Untrusted
witness generation is in `source/GenerateProfiles.py`. Source: the preserved
ATLAS degree-4060 representation, GLS3 Table 5.3r; this geometry supports the
[Asc86b] application on Aschbacher--Smith printed p.511.
-/

